&lt;li&gt;Organised: You think and act logically to progress deals in volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious: You want to understand your customers and their paint points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to challenge the status quo: Your ability to build strong relationships enables you to influence and challenge the norm&lt;/li&gt;
